# Lines for /etc/hosts on the display device, so its browser can open
# http://app:3000. Use the addresses chosen for the booth network (design
# section 4.1) and keep them identical to DB_HOST, LLM_HOST, EMBED_HOST and
# APP_HOST in .env. Neither the containers (extra_hosts in docker-compose.yml)
# nor the scripts (IPs from .env) need this file.
10.77.0.11  llm
10.77.0.12  embed
10.77.0.13  app
10.77.0.14  db
